 "description": "Search for countries by name. Returns official name, capital, region, population, area, languages, currencies, flag emoji, and the country's land borders by name \u2014 so \"which countries border Bolivia\" is answerable directly.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "examples": [
   {
    "query": "United States"
   },
   {
    "query": "New"
   }
  ],
  "properties": {
